YiZiJue-LM v0.1

This project provides an Agent intent proposal model and local runtime wrapper
for OneCode.

Base model:
Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B
License: Apache-2.0

Qwen3-0.6B provides the base semantic capability. The Agent-specific training
data pipeline, LoRA adapter, strict action schema, evaluation guard, local
service wrapper, tests, and OneCode control-plane contract are developed by
this project.

The release artifact does not include the full Qwen3-0.6B base weights.
